@startuml activity-object-registration
!include _style.puml
skinparam wrapWidth 170

|User|
|Web application|
|API|
|User|
start
:Open the form
for a new object;
if (Use ArtPilot?) then (yes)
  :Upload a document
  or photo;
  |API|
  :ArtPilot proposes field
  values (via OpenRouter);
else (no)
endif
|User|
repeat
  :Enter or correct the data,
  add materials, measurements,
  attributions and images;
  |Web application|
  :Check the form and
  send the object to the API;
  |API|
  :Validate the request;
repeat while (Valid?) is (no) not (yes)
:Save the object with a
"Created" event, assign the
inventory number, index it
in Elasticsearch;
|Web application|
:Send images, measurements
and attributions as
separate requests;
|API|
:Per image: store it in MinIO,
then compute its embedding;
|Web application|
:Show the object
detail page;
stop
@enduml
